: CONNECTSQLANDGETINFO$ ( server$ user$ password$ -$- info$ ) ( infotype -- )

    DEPTH$ 3 U< IF STRINGSTACKUNDERFLOWERROR PUSHOERROR0$ NAME>E EXIT THEN

    ALLOCATEHSQLCONN ?ERRORIF DROP$ DROP$ DROP$ NAME>E EXIT THEN

    0 SETHSQLCONNTIMEOUT ?ERRORIF DROP$ DROP$ DROP$ FREEHSQLCONN NAME>E EXIT THEN

